+## Reader Standard
+
+The movement is suitable for the specified thirteen-year-old reader. It contains no profanity, obscenity, crude slang, blasphemous oath, sexual content, or innuendo. Violence is non-gory, spatially legible, and followed by pain, recovery, or social consequence. Betting is present as part of the circuit economy, but the dispute is framed around responsibility and honest records rather than glamorized easy gain.
